      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T03:35:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: suggest moving this to a method in Registration (something like `boolean matches(NsdServiceInfo)`). It would make this method a bit easier to read, and having methods comparing data objects inside the objects themselves often makes it easier to notice that they need to be updated when members are added.\n\nAfter the change to move the subtypes to NsdServiceInfo, this could be renamed to \"matchesExceptSubtype\" or similar.",
