      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T03:35:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Similarly to the comment in MdnsRecordRepository: if isOnlyUpdate you go through one flow; otherwise, you go through another one\n\nInstead of having one method that executes 2 independent code paths depending on a boolean argument, I think it\u0027s generally clearer to have 2 separate methods (addService and updateService). Another advantage is that NameConflictException can\u0027t be thrown when updating, so callers shouldn\u0027t have to care about it when updating.",
      "revId": "9e9d7c0a62d7f88658244153835c212b3c974ae0",
